{"4984870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Selkie's Salvage&Co.", "steam_appid": 4984870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ocean full of precious garbage - just for you! Time to get fishing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expanding your Operation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind garbage down to buy upgrades to fish garbage faster to buy more upgrades to do it EVEN FASTER!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/3a133af9fb44f2a75222fbd22b4a0ff5.poster.avif?t=1786573729\" width=958 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/3a133af9fb44f2a75222fbd22b4a0ff5.webm?t=1786573729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/3a133af9fb44f2a75222fbd22b4a0ff5.mp4?t=1786573729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new tools to speed up the effort!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/a1a3e4f4b8298dc21f5ae6cf782940c5.poster.avif?t=1786573729\" width=958 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/a1a3e4f4b8298dc21f5ae6cf782940c5.webm?t=1786573729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/a1a3e4f4b8298dc21f5ae6cf782940c5.mp4?t=1786573729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Treasure Hunting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world to uncover relics from the past that provide game changing bonuses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/59170837c290048e3e6a3cceddb4e608.poster.avif?t=1786573729\" width=958 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/59170837c290048e3e6a3cceddb4e608.webm?t=1786573729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/59170837c290048e3e6a3cceddb4e608.mp4?t=1786573729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shooting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooting garbage also counts as grinding it down? </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ocean full of precious garbage - just for you! Time to get fishing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expanding your Operation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind garbage down to buy upgrades to fish garbage faster to buy more upgrades to do it EVEN FASTER!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/3a133af9fb44f2a75222fbd22b4a0ff5.poster.avif?t=1786573729\" width=958 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/3a133af9fb44f2a75222fbd22b4a0ff5.webm?t=1786573729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/3a133af9fb44f2a75222fbd22b4a0ff5.mp4?t=1786573729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new tools to speed up the effort!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/a1a3e4f4b8298dc21f5ae6cf782940c5.poster.avif?t=1786573729\" width=958 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/a1a3e4f4b8298dc21f5ae6cf782940c5.webm?t=1786573729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/a1a3e4f4b8298dc21f5ae6cf782940c5.mp4?t=1786573729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Treasure Hunting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world to uncover relics from the past that provide game changing bonuses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/59170837c290048e3e6a3cceddb4e608.poster.avif?t=1786573729\" width=958 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/59170837c290048e3e6a3cceddb4e608.webm?t=1786573729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/extras/59170837c290048e3e6a3cceddb4e608.mp4?t=1786573729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shooting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooting garbage also counts as grinding it down? </p>", "short_description": "Selkie’s Salvage&amp;Co. is a first-person physics based incremental fishing game. Your task is to clean up the flooded planet! Fish up scrap, grind all of it down and collect trinkets of the past. Expand your salvaging operation and go beyond!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984870/7c53ff84a05f4fbb9f85fe1a1fc61125ad587a0b/header.jpg?t=1786573729", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st